44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"- **Takumi**: @Shion, the seniors say mixing only happens in the evenings when we sleep together. That's the real test.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Shion, the hall is unusable. @Minato, did the transport costs make the inland option unviable?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: @Asuka, the inland accounts show eight to a room with lights out at eleven. That’s the sleep data I needed.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,- **Minato**: The transport receipts show it was the biggest cost last year. I’m worried about the budget again.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @Minato, transport was thirty-eight percent of the total. @Takumi, the whole-building deposit is non-refundable, so late dropouts cost the rest of us.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, that’s a real risk. But the attendance sheets show a fifth never came, and most left by winter. We need people who actually show up.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Misaki, that non-refundable deposit is a liability. @Shion, does the public rate sheet cover the equipment costs too?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, yes. The prefecture rate sheet folds hall and equipment use into the 1,100 yen nightly charge. It’s a flat, predictable cost.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I found that the canteen closes, so cooking duty took two hours daily. A place with kitchen staff would save us that exhaustion.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, the public rate is fixed at 1,100 yen per bed. That predictability helps me close the account gap without surprises.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Misaki"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Misaki: @Asuka, the public rate is fixed at 1,100 yen per bed. That predictability helps me close the account gap without surprises.""}]}"
54,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, the seniors confirm mixing only happens when we sleep together. The public centre’s dorms are the only way to force that interaction.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
