72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: The vote is unanimous for A. We are proceeding with the Mountain Training Centre.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minato,,- **Minato**: That’s great. I’m relieved we found a place that won’t drain our energy or the budget.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Takumi,,- **Takumi**: Good. Now we just have to make sure everyone actually shows up this time.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: Agreed. I’ll start the application process immediately to secure our booking.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
